.TH octosnap-add-overlay 1  OctoSnap 
.SH NAME
octosnap\-add\-overlay \- Add an image file to the Quick Access Overlay as a card
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBoctosnap add\-overlay\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPATH\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add an image file to the Quick Access Overlay as a card
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPATH\fR>
The image file, or `\-` to read one from standard input
